&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mesh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mesh, our mission is to enable consumers to pay and be paid with any asset. Today, trillions of dollars in tokenized assets exist but remain largely unusable for everyday commerce. Mesh is bridging this gap by making crypto payments reliable, useful, and ubiquitous. We combine a powerful orchestration engine with a seamless consumer app to unlock liquidity for the world. Backed by leading investors like SBI, Money Forward, Paradigm, Dragonfly, Galaxy, and PayPal Ventures, we are building the infrastructure for the next era of the global economy. Join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;229&quot; data-end=&quot;555&quot;&gt;Mesh moves money across hundreds of exchanges, wallets and chains. The data that flow generates is now a product in its own right: clients want to see their conversion, volume and settlement data, Finance needs reporting they can sign, and our own teams answer most questions by asking an AI agent instead of filing a ticket. You&#39;ll own how we define, instrument, validate and ship that data, working hands-on in SQL and Python and building the guardrails that let AI agents query our data safely.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own product and client analytics.&lt;/strong&gt; Define core metrics (conversion rates, transaction success rates) and maintain the central Amplitude data with reusable, templated charts. Build internal and external dashboards for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run experiment readouts.&lt;/strong&gt; Baseline and read out A/B tests on the flow (UI variants, algorithms) and turn results into product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prove migrations with data.&lt;/strong&gt; Build apples-to-apples comparisons between platforms so decisions move on evidence, not gut feel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guard data integrity.&lt;/strong&gt; Run and automate daily reconciliation triage and the verification engine.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape instrumentation.&lt;/strong&gt; Define backend event schemas and the tracking plan, and normalize fields so the data is clean enough for analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build finance-grade reporting.&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver settlement and billing reporting on Microsoft Fabric / Power BI with parity validation, alerting and self-serve access for Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make data AI-native.&lt;/strong&gt; Build skills and tools for our internal data agent, log and audit agent-generated SQL, and keep the self-serve data channels accurate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn data into client products.&lt;/strong&gt; Help shape self-serve reporting, reconciliation and billing exports that clients pay for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in SQL (T-SQL / SQL Server and Spark SQL a plus) and solid in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with product analytics (Amplitude, Mixpanel or similar), including event design and funnel/CVR modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with experiment design and statistics for A/B readouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced building data quality checks, reconciliations or backfills on production data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In the habit of validating numbers against source systems before anyone else sees them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear writer who can explain a data issue to an engineer, a CRO and a client in the same day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily user of AI coding and analysis tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;~3+ years in analytics or data engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;~5+ years with end-to-end ownership of a data domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range provided may span multiple career levels and will be narrowed during the interview process based on factors including a candidate&#39;s experience, skills, qualifications, and geographic location. For candidates outside of New York or San Francisco, compensation will be adjusted to reflect the applicable market and location-based pay band. The base salary range listed excludes commission (if applicable), equity, and benefits. The pay range represents the minimum and maximum target for new-hire compensation. Actual compensation may vary and may be higher or lower depending on individual circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$180,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love It Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
